<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Desc outlines dividend payment.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Desc outlines dividend payment.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican conglomerate Desc SA announced Wednesday through the Mexican Stock Exchange that it will pay a dividend from May 9 of 0.55 peso per share and another dividend in shares.</p>
<p>Desc said the share dividend will be made up of a new series &quot;C&quot; share, given for every 100 shares held of series &quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot; and &quot;C&quot; in current circulation.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7287902))</p>
